<title>USA: Datatrend says SEC conducting probe of co.</title>
<headline>Datatrend says SEC conducting probe of co.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH BRAINTREE, Mass. 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Datatrend Services Inc said Friday the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission is conducting an informal inquiry of the company to determine whether the company violated federal securities laws.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it was &quot;not aware of any such violations and is not currently aware of the basis for the investigation.&quot;</p>
<p>Officials at Datatrend were not immediately available to comment further.</p>
</text>
